{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1197779-channel-zero-butcher-s-block","id":1197779,"title":"Channel Zero: Butcher's block","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-20T16:30:26-07:00","id":1197779,"title":"Channel Zero: Butcher's block","content":"Not to spoil to those who haven't seen it yet, but how would you stat the entity from the series? Or better yet, all of the entities, even from previous seasons? <br /> The reason I'm asking is I can't seem to stat weirdness in my games... <br /> How do you stat something like that?<br /> And to those who watched it, what do you think? Somehow, all three seasons give off a strong CofD vibe, at least to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1191-rosencroft","name":"Rosencroft","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-20T18:41:04-07:00","id":1197822,"title":"","content":"Which entities? There's a few things running around in all three of the seasons so far.<br /> <br /> They're pretty good CofD inspirations (esp. running pure humans instead of supernaturals for PCs), but there's also plenty of plot stuff for some of the entities where stating them really isn't that important. The No-End House itself doesn't really need 'stats' since it mostly just 'is' to justify the things that the characters interact with more directly. The entity the Peaches work for could be done in a few ways.... but again... what does it really do that the main characters need to worry about directly where mechanics matter? It's job in the story is to let the Peaches do what they can do, so working on their abilities is more important.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}